@CivicConnect.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228
@staffToken = paste-staff-jwt-here
@adminToken = paste-admin-jwt-here

GET {{CivicConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Search requests assigned to the authenticated staff member
GET {{CivicConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/staff/requests?status=assign&category=it&dueDate=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admin request queue, including unassigned requests
GET {{CivicConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/admin/requests?unassigned=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
